- **Dogs Core**: DHPP (Distemper, Hepatitis/Adenovirus, Parvovirus, Parainfluenza) starting at 6-8 weeks, boosted every 3-4 weeks until 16 weeks, then 1 year, and every 3 years thereafter. Rabies vaccine is legally mandated starting at 12-16 weeks with regular booster intervals.
- **Dogs Non-Core**: Leptospirosis, Bordetella (Kennel Cough), Lyme disease depending on lifestyle and regional exposure.
- **Cats Core**: FVRCP (Feline Viral Rhinotracheitis, Calicivirus, Panleukopenia) and Rabies.
- **Cats Non-Core**: FeLV (Feline Leukemia Virus) strongly advised for outdoor/multicat cats.', 'ASSISTANT', 'KNOWLEDGE_BASE', 'knowledgeBase:VACCINATION', 9, NULL);
